00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:26,000
He never met a target he couldn't take. Until today.

2
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:46,000
Killshot is a crime, drama, thriller film directed by John Madden.

3
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:06,000
Beautiful Carmen Colson and her ironworker husband Wayne are placed in the
Federal Witness Protection program after witnessing an "incident".

4
00:25:20,000 --> 00:25:26,000
Thinking they are at last safe, they are targeted by an experienced
hit man and a psychopathic young upstart killer.

5
00:31:40,000 --> 00:31:46,000
Armand 'The Blackbird' Degas, played by Mickey Rourke.

6
00:38:00,000 --> 00:38:06,000
Carmen Colson, played by Diane Lane.

7
00:44:20,000 --> 00:44:26,000
Wayne Colson, played by Thomas Jane.

8
00:50:40,000 --> 00:50:46,000
Donna, played by Rosario Dawson.

9
00:57:00,000 --> 00:57:06,000
Richie Nix, played by Joseph Gordon-Levitt.

10
01:03:20,000 --> 01:03:26,000
Blackbird's Kid Brother, played by Brandon McGibbon.

11
01:09:40,000 --> 01:09:46,000
Killshot is a 2008 American action thriller independent film directed by John Madden, and
starring Diane Lane, Thomas Jane, Mickey Rourke and Joseph Gordon-Levitt.

12
01:16:00,000 --> 01:16:06,000
It is based on Elmore Leonard's 1989 novel of the same name.

13
01:22:20,000 --> 01:22:26,000
The story follows a couple who, despite being in a Witness Protection Program,
are being chased and confronted by the criminal they outed.

14
01:28:40,000 --> 01:28:46,000
The tone is emotional and intense.
